+# Guarded x87 region API regression
+
+`X87Region.cpp` is the byte-identical source tested by the private native32
+runner build in `OWN/native-0163-region10/SOURCE.json`. It calls the real
+integer widening, entry guard and transactional recovery APIs; accepted
+arithmetic sequences are checked against SoftFloat and ARM64 FP instructions.
+
+Validated: 200018 widening inputs, 512 recovery states, 16 negative recovery
+conditions, 75000 guard inputs, 335220 arithmetic operations, zero failures.
+The test requires AArch64 and the normal FEXCore/SoftFloat include and link
+configuration. The lane's existing `build-native-0163-region.py` target
+`x87_region_unit` builds and runs it; the source SHA is checked against this
+copy. No Windows guest, application launch, or timing is involved.
+
+Actual JIT execution is checked separately by the existing stand32 runner:
+198 loops; asynchronous and seven deterministic fault sites; immutable
+hardware and recorded-game corpora. These API tests do not prove Windows
+suspend/resume or runtime code-cache save/load.
